mcp-types (2.0.0~b2-1~vitex1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New source package: mcp-types, the wire-types dependency split
    out of the mcp SDK's v2 line. Packaged to satisfy mcp 2.0.0b2's
    dependency, needed for the mcprack fastmcp 4.0.0a2 migration.
    Epoch/tilde-versioning mirrors the existing python-mcp packaging
    convention for this pre-release line.

